{
  "title": "Double Musky Express!!!",
  "slug": "double-musky-express",
  "date": "2009-06-06",
  "section": "travel",
  "summary": "Below are pictures from a trip I refer to as The Double Musky Express! The trip basically entails collecting up as many of your friends as you can, flying to Alaska, doing some site seeing, and having dinner at The Double Musky - the best restaurant in Alaska if not the entire West coast! Now most folks can figure out how to pull that off without too much trouble, but to do all of that in less than 36 hours is what makes it the Express!",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Below are pictures from a trip I refer to as The Double Musky Express! The trip basically entails collecting up as many of your friends as you can, flying to Alaska, doing some site seeing, and having dinner at The Double Musky - the best restaurant in Alaska if not the entire West coast! Now most folks can figure out how to pull that off without too much trouble, but to do all of that in less than 36 hours is what makes it the Express!",
      "links": []
    }
  ],
